			<attribute key="id" type="int">32</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.
---
1. Normal test cases
1.1. Both strings are anagrams (string length more than 1)
1.2. Both strings are of same length (length more than 1), but not anagrams
1.3. Both strings are of different lengths
1.4. Both strings are same
---
2. Boundary test cases
2.1. Both strings are of size 1 and anagrams
2.2. Both strings are of size 1 but not anagrams
2.3. Both strings are almost anagrams except for 1 character

Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 7 new test cases.

Write them on a paper.</attribute>
